  "description": "Provider-neutral core of OLAX file storage: options, the storage provider contract, storage keys, content checks, signed proxy URLs, CDN URL signing (CloudFront, Cloud CDN) and the HTTP endpoints. Add Olax.Storage.EntityFrameworkCore for the file metadata and a provider package (FileSystem, S3, Google, Azure).",
